# This repo is published to the public web.
# Nothing but the encrypted app belongs here.
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf
*-offline.html
index.html.bak

# The model is plaintext: tax table, take-home, living costs, the payoff.
# It is only ever read by the tools, never shipped.
model.cjs
_model.cjs
*.cjs

# Working dumps and exports. cfgdump.txt held the live mortgage balance, cash
# and VTI figures in plaintext while sitting untracked-but-not-ignored, which
# is one `git add -A` away from being public. Anything of this shape is data,
# not app, so it is excluded by shape rather than by name.
cfgdump.txt
*dump*.txt
*.json
!manifest.webmanifest
notes.txt
scratch*
*.bak

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
